<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SIMSMETAL YR NET PROFIT A$35.17 MLN.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SIMSMETAL YR NET PROFIT A$35.17 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metals recycler Simsmetal Ltd said on Tuesday reported a A$35.17 million unaudited net profit for the year to June 30, down 25 percent on the previous corresponding period.</p>
<p>Fourth quarter profit was A$13.11 million, an increase of 64 percent on third quarter 1996/97.</p>
<p>Simsmetal said operating revenue for the year was marginally lower at A$1.15 billion.</p>
</text>
